| **Command**       | **What it does**                                  |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| `ip a`            | Displays IP addresses and network interfaces.     |
| `ip route`        | Displays the routing table.                       |
| `ping host`       | Tests network connectivity.                       |
| `curl URL`        | Retrieves data from a URL.                        |
| `wget URL`        | Downloads files from the web.                     |
| `ss -tulnp`       | Displays listening ports and network connections. |
| `netstat -tulnp`  | Shows network connections (older command).        |
| `traceroute host` | Shows the network path to a host.                 |
| `nslookup domain` | Looks up DNS records.                             |
| `dig domain`      | Retrieves detailed DNS information.               |
| `hostname -I`     | Displays the system's IP address.                 |
